+**Context**: `INTENT.md`'s opening note and closing line, `AGENTS.md` "Consult INTENT.md for significant decisions" and the local guard's check 3 each tell any human or AI session to edit `INTENT.md` directly, with a dated note. No file names who decides what the project is for (open question 1), so a session can change the north star without anyone having decided it.
